    "status": 200,
    "markdown": "![Hugging Face's logo](https://huggingface.co/front/assets/huggingface_logo-noborder.svg) Hugging Face⟨1⟩\n  *  Models ⟨2⟩\n  *  Datasets ⟨3⟩\n  *  Spaces ⟨4⟩\n  *  Buckets new⟨5⟩\n  *  Docs ⟨6⟩\n  *  Enterprise ⟨7⟩\n  * Pricing⟨8⟩\n  *     * Website\n      *  Tasks⟨9⟩\n      *  HuggingChat⟨10⟩\n      *  Collections⟨11⟩\n      *  Languages⟨12⟩\n      *  Organizations⟨13⟩\n    * Community\n      *  Blog⟨14⟩\n      *  Posts⟨15⟩\n      *  Daily Papers⟨16⟩\n      *  Hardware⟨17⟩\n      *  Learn⟨18⟩\n      *  Discord⟨19⟩\n      *  Forum⟨20⟩\n      *  GitHub⟨21⟩\n    * Solutions\n      *  Team & Enterprise⟨7⟩\n      *  Hugging Face PRO⟨22⟩\n      *  Enterprise Support⟨23⟩\n      *  Inference Providers⟨24⟩\n      *  Inference Endpoints⟨25⟩\n      *  Storage Buckets⟨5⟩\n  * * * *\n  * Log In⟨26⟩\n  * Sign Up⟨27⟩\n\n\n#   Datasets:⟨3⟩\n* * *\n ![](https://huggingface.co/avatars/f0f94e0219906e685f87b2cddd754619.svg) ⟨28⟩\nUncertainty-42⟨28⟩\n/\nMSCOCO_NAMLab_pt⟨29⟩\nlike 0\nTasks:  Image Segmentation ⟨30⟩\nTags:  wsss ⟨31⟩ boundary-refinement ⟨32⟩ priors ⟨33⟩\nLicense:\nmit\n Dataset card ⟨29⟩ Files Files and versions xet ⟨34⟩ Community ⟨35⟩\nDataset Viewer\nThe dataset viewer is not available because its heuristics could not detect any supported data files⟨36⟩. You can try uploading⟨37⟩ some data files, or configuring⟨38⟩ the data files location manually.\n  * 🔗 Main Codebase⟨39⟩\n  * 📂 Expected Directory Layout⟨40⟩\n  * 📥 Concatenation & Extraction Guide⟨41⟩\n  * 📝 Citation & Attribution⟨42⟩\n\n\n#   ⟨43⟩ MS COCO 2014 NAMLab Priors for HGA \nThis dataset repository hosts the pre-computed hierarchical invariant region partition priors for weakly supervised semantic segmentation (WSSS) on MS COCO 2014, generated using the NAMLab framework.\nDue to Hugging Face's individual file size limits, the total ~63.69 GB dataset is uploaded as a **split-volume zip archive** (`priors_coco.zip.part1` to `priors_coco.zip.part3`). You must concatenate them locally before extraction.\n##   ⟨39⟩ 🔗 Main Codebase \nThe complete implementation, environment setup, and training guidelines are available in our official GitHub repository: 👉 **Uncertainty-42/HGA⟨44⟩**\n##   ⟨40⟩ 📂 Expected Directory Layout \nAfter concatenation and extraction, the folder structure should match the following layout:\n\n```\nMSCOCO/\n├── JPEGImages/                \n│   ├── train/                 \n│   └── val/                   \n└── priors/                    \n    └── namlab_pt/             # <- Extract here (will automatically create train/ and val/)\n\n```\n\n##   ⟨41⟩ 📥 Concatenation & Extraction Guide \nNavigate to your local `priors/` directory where the downloaded split parts reside, and run the following commands to reconstruct and extract the dataset:\n\n```\n# Step 1: Concatenate the split parts into a single valid zip archive\ncat priors_coco.zip.part* > priors_coco.zip\n\n# Step 2: Extract the contents into namlab_pt/\nunzip priors_coco.zip -d namlab_pt/\n\n# Step 3: Clean up the temporary archive and parts (Optional)\nrm priors_coco.zip.part* priors_coco.zip\n\n```\n\n##   ⟨42⟩ 📝 Citation & Attribution \nIf you use these priors in your research, please cite both our work and the foundational NAMLab paper:\n\n```\n@article{zheng2021hierarchical,\n  title={Hierarchical Image Segmentation Based on Nonsymmetry and Anti-Packing Pattern Representation Model},\n  author={Zheng, Yunping and Yang, Bowen and Sarem, Mudar},\n  journal={IEEE Transactions on Image Processing},\n  volume={30},\n  pages={2408--2421},\n  year={2021},\n  publisher={IEEE}\n}\n\n```\n\nCopy to bucket new \n\nDownloads last month\n    60\nTotal file size: 68.4 GB\nSystem theme\nCompany\nTOS⟨45⟩ Privacy⟨46⟩ About⟨47⟩ Careers⟨48⟩ ⟨1⟩\nWebsite\nModels⟨2⟩ Datasets⟨3⟩ Spaces⟨4⟩ Pricing⟨8⟩ Docs⟨6⟩\n",
